Z||000002||Jncomutt||12-02-2001||04:17 PM||||Different article, BTW.<P>I have no problem with imports.  My sister is inlove with her Hondas.  I helped her build up her CRX to what it is today, and let me tell ya, it will spank on most Mustangs and Camaros it comes across.  <P>As mentioned, I didn't say this was to prove facts of whats right and wrong, if you read it, it actually IS funny.<P>What I belive, however, is that the Honda items should stay on the honda.  When I see a really nice hopped up Del Sol, I respect it and usually will spark up convo with the owner and such.  The problem arises in my opinion when you start puttin the chinese lettering on your escorts and cavaliers.  Keep your glow nozzles and 4" tips where they're respected (in some opinions) on the imports.  Thas all.. No flame intended. ||||reg||1
