Z||000031||SLAMMED87GT||12-02-2001||10:13 PM||||OK Kiddy's!!!!! Now stop fighting.... <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_watchout.gif"><P>Some American cars are made slow. <BR>Some American cars are made fast.<BR>Either way they CAN be made faster.<P>Some Import cars are made slow.<BR>Some Import cars are made fast.<BR>Either way they CAN be made faster.<P>You can't be on one side of this discussion and say "I'm right, your wrong!"  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif"> There are so many comparisons you can make regarding which car is faster, which handles better. Also, comparing old MUSCLE cars and new IMPORTS is just  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_bs.gif"> . They are from different era's. The article is humurous  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> , and that is just what it is for.<P>Bicker, bicker.....are we married?!?! <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"><P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Pfierosig2.jpg"> <P><P>------------------<BR>3" Drop, 17" Primax 618s/Nitto540 205/40, 4" Monza exhaust, Mudstain decklid scoop, 7" wing stands, Clear front and rear lights, custom interior, all options...that's all hehe.||||reg||4
Z||000032||sloth85GT||12-02-2001||10:29 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by yo_sweet:<BR><B>i think a berettta gtz quad 4 could take a integra type r , just drop a k&n air filter to make up the hp   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Ummmm my stock 85GT has beaten a Beretta GTZ.....and when I get the LT1 in it, the car will be worth under $10,000 and pound the doors off of a $40,000 (or whatever amount of money those guys waste on it) Integra Type R. It's just a matter of power per dollar. I hate hondas with a passion, maybe that opinion could have been different if so many ricers didn't have to ruin it by going for upgrading the body and looks before even touching the engine. This has also been done to a Fiero, that guy with the black GT with that UGLY carbon fiber wing and the DVD player. I asked him what his enging mods are, he said it's stock.....What's up with that? My paint sucks, I don't have much money, but what little money I DO have, will go to performance before looks. AFTER the LT1, I will shoot some paint on her. I don't have to make my Fiero look like something it's not. If guys like Civics so much, then why change to body so much that you can't even tell what it is? I would like imports more if they weren't always riced. And rice doesn't make sense to me....<P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.mts.net/~kuzma/fieronl.gif">     <BR>Dan<BR>1985 Silver GT||||reg||1
Z||000033||Spektrum-87GT||12-02-2001||10:37 PM||||lol, reading this was too funny<P>lets face it, to each his own, whatever floats your boat. but personally,i think anyone who takes an econocar made for transportation and tries to make it fast... excuse me, BAHAHAHAHAHAAHA. ahem, thats what i think. another thing thats funny... they're whole outlook is hypocritical. 'lets take a cookie cutter car and make it look original, just like every other original rice burner out there!'<P>to end this...<BR> <IMG SRC="http://members.home.com/bspracklin1/rice.jpg"> <P>courtesy of blackstang  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/spektrum_87gt/" TARGET=_blank>87 Fiero GT</A><BR>1991 Jeep Cherokee<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://members.home.com/bspracklin1/sig2.jpg">   <BR>AIM:<FONT COLOR="red">S</FONT><FONT COLOR="purple">p</FONT><FONT COLOR="blue">e</FONT><FONT COLOR="cyan">k</FONT><FONT COLOR="green">t</FONT><FONT COLOR="yellow">r</FONT><FONT COLOR="orange">u</FONT><FONT COLOR="red">m</FONT><FONT COLOR="purple">1</FONT><FONT COLOR="blue">1</FONT><FONT COLOR="cyan">7</FONT><BR>And no! i'm not gay dangit!||||reg||1
Z||000034||BlackStang95||12-02-2001||11:01 PM||||Hell yeah, i make my opinion known with no apologies.  There have been some great japanese cars, 3000gt turbo, supra turbo, 300zx twin turbo, rx7 turbo, some mr2's...but that's about it, and none of those are made anymore except the mr2.  All those cars are great if they are not riced.  Clear tailights and limegreen is frickin ugly no matter what car its on or how fast it runs.  Bottom line is american cars are generally faster and in my opinion cooler than any imports.  ||||reg||1
